### Create a book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Atomic Habits",
  "author": "James Clear",
  "publicationYear": 2018
}

### Get a book by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Get a book that does not exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999


### Create a few more books for paging
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Enterprise Integration Patterns", "author": "Gregor Hohpe", "publicationYear": 2003 }

### Another
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer", "author": "Andrew Hunt", "publicationYear": 1999 }

### Another
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Clean Code", "author": "Robert Martin", "publicationYear": 2008 }

### Another
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Design Patterns", "author": "Erich Gamma", "publicationYear": 1994 }

### List all books, default paging
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### First page, two per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=0&size=2

### Second page, two per page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=2

### Sorted by publication year, newest first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?sort=publicationYear,desc


### Update a book, fixing the author name
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "publicationYear": 2008
}

### Update a book that does not exist
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nothing",
  "author": "Nobody",
  "publicationYear": 2000
}

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/5

### Delete a book that does not exist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/999